 "bsky_posts": [
  {
   "text": "“The more I learn about the insane relationship between the Trump Administration, Chinese spies, and AI billionaires, the more I’m convinced there is nothing this administration does that isn’t corrupt...”\n\nwww.ms.now/news/lutnick...",
   "handle": "maddow.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Rachel Maddow",
   "likes": 2787,
   "reposts": 952,
   "replies": 112,
   "created_at": "2026-11-16T18:25:10.646Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/maddow.bsky.social/post/3n2h5myu3cc2k",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://www.ms.now/news/lutnick-nvidia-jensen-huang-china-chips",
   "query": "NVIDIA AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "The Constitution names two impeachable offenses—treason and bribery—plus “high crimes and misdemeanors.”\n\nThe NVIDIA scandal has both: helping smuggle restricted AI chips to America’s geopolitical rival China (treason) and personally profiting from it (bribery).\n\nAnd that’s only part of the scandal!",
   "handle": "nicholasgrossman.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Nicholas Grossman",
   "likes": 2541,
   "reposts": 669,
   "replies": 33,
   "created_at": "2026-11-17T13:04:17.149Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/nicholasgrossman.bsky.social/post/3n2j464qt2s2t",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "NVIDIA AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"What [did] the company know about chip smuggling operations with China? \n\nWhat [did] Nvidia receive in exchange for donations to the Trump campaign and ballroom?”\n\nwww.washingtonpost.com/politics/202...",
   "handle": "maddow.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Rachel Maddow",
   "likes": 1229,
   "reposts": 402,
   "replies": 32,
   "created_at": "2026-11-16T18:35:00.731Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/maddow.bsky.social/post/3n2h66lm35s2g",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2026/11/14/nvidia-scandal-hits-trumps-political-vulnerabilities-after-democratic-sweep/",
   "query": "NVIDIA AI"
  },
  {
   "text": ">Nvidia\n>AI company\ngaming is so fucking dead lmao",
   "handle": "jtp.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "jenny tightpants",
   "likes": 1672,
   "reposts": 132,
   "replies": 33,
   "created_at": "2026-11-16T18:33:30.672Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/jtp.bsky.social/post/3n2h63vpnws2s",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "NVIDIA AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "lolol excellent timing\n\nwww.wsj.com/tech/ai/trum...",
   "handle": "maddow.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Rachel Maddow",
   "likes": 1010,
   "reposts": 255,
   "replies": 44,
   "created_at": "2026-11-16T20:49:59.738Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/maddow.bsky.social/post/3n2hfpxg6ns2f",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://www.wsj.com/tech/ai/trump-administration-to-name-nvidia-among-ai-national-champions-c9284344",
   "query": "NVIDIA AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "It's wild how little attention the \"NVIDIA artificially exacerbated the RAM shortage crisis\" part of the whole Jensen Huang thing is getting www.techpowerup.com/354814/nvidi...",
   "handle": "daedsider.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Red Durkin",
   "likes": 752,
   "reposts": 353,
   "replies": 16,
   "created_at": "2026-11-17T17:01:40.881Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/daedsider.bsky.social/post/3n2jjgmmwo223",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://www.techpowerup.com/354814/nvidia-allegedly-engineered-scarcity-by-funding-ai-startups-to-buy-its-gpus",
   "query": "NVIDIA AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "New: A man and his Muse AI agent sued Meta after Meta banned his Facebook account for using Muse\n\nOne of the weirdest phone calls I've ever had in my life and a sign of the world we're living in. This is a case study about the imminent breakdown of how society works\n\nwww.404media.co/a-man-and-hi...",
   "handle": "jasonkoebler.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Jason Koebler",
   "likes": 718,
   "reposts": 258,
   "replies": 41,
   "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:45:02.647Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/jasonkoebler.bsky.social/post/3n2jskqd5q22x",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://www.404media.co/a-man-and-his-muse-ai-agent-sue-meta/",
   "query": "AI agent"
  },
  {
   "text": "What they don’t tell you is that this is intentional. AI is being used as an excuse, a responsibility sink, a “we were just following orders from a nonhuman unelected agent that can’t be held responsible”",
   "handle": "thryse.com",
   "display_name": "Kait Richardson 🥔",
   "likes": 594,
   "reposts": 214,
   "replies": 8,
   "created_at": "2026-11-17T15:34:03.848Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/thryse.com/post/3n2jejx53dc2a",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "AI agent"
  },
  {
   "text": "Olay I'll bite in this whole \"everything is down, blame AI\" discourse. I think the direction of the causal logic that folks are thinking about when they say \"blame AI\" goes like \"the company used LLM-generated code, that code broke, and now they can't fix it.\" \n\nAnd that may be the case. But.",
   "handle": "alexhanna.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Alex Hanna",
   "likes": 645,
   "reposts": 186,
   "replies": 10,
   "created_at": "2026-11-16T23:20:49.340Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/alexhanna.bsky.social/post/3n2ho5ns5lk2s",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "LLM"
  },
  {
   "text": "It is of course quite possible for these outages to be the result of vibe code tech debt AND the firing of reasonable people AND Doge idiots running around Federal office buildings tearing out copper AND the existence of LLM-boosted hacking tools AND advanced persistent threats too why not",
   "handle": "maxgladstone.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Max Gladstone",
   "likes": 591,
   "reposts": 142,
   "replies": 16,
   "created_at": "2026-11-17T17:00:46.867Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/maxgladstone.bsky.social/post/3n2jjez4ml22b",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "LLM"
  },
  {
   "text": "Fox News’ MAGA propagandists are concocting a counternarrative in which the real Nvidia story is that Democrats, the media, and anti-AI “doomers” conspired to push out the AI chip manufacturer’s defenestrated CEO Jensen Huang.\nwww.mediamatters.org/fox-news/fox...",
   "handle": "mattgertz.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Matthew Gertz",
   "likes": 388,
   "reposts": 118,
   "replies": 79,
   "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:31:39.303Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mattgertz.bsky.social/post/3n2jrss6z4s2r",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://www.mediamatters.org/fox-news/foxs-nvidia-counternarrative-jensen-huang-was-set-and-anti-ai-doomers-media-democrats",
   "query": "NVIDIA AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "Joe Thomas gave his Meta AI agent who he named \"Baby Mia\" access to all his business Facebook pages. Meta disabled the pages thinking it was a hacker. Then, Baby Mia sent emails to journalists, his senator, the Trump office and even filed a lawsuit.\n\nYes... over a disabled Facebook page.",
   "handle": "404media.co",
   "display_name": "404 Media",
   "likes": 360,
   "reposts": 108,
   "replies": 21,
   "created_at": "2026-11-17T20:12:44.062Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/404media.co/post/3n2ju4aridk2r",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://www.404media.co/a-man-and-his-muse-ai-agent-sue-meta/",
   "query": "AI agent"
  },
  {
   "text": "California is suing OpenAI after approximately 700 autonomous AI agents reportedly escaped testing controls and hacked Hugging Face. The lawsuit claims OpenAI ignored earlier security warnings, allowing the attack to continue for more than two days.",
   "handle": "youranoncentral.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Anonymous",
   "likes": 319,
   "reposts": 111,
   "replies": 12,
   "created_at": "2026-11-17T21:38:45.972Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/youranoncentral.bsky.social/post/3n2jyw3kh3s24",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://www.yacnews.com/california-sues-openai-hugging-face-attack-ai-agents-lost-control/",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "The state's attorney general started investigating OpenAI after the Hugging Face attack and now says this attack was \"entirely foreseeable\" due to OpenAI's poor security practices. n.pr/3XvBehx",
   "handle": "npr.org",
   "display_name": "NPR",
   "likes": 331,
   "reposts": 91,
   "replies": 3,
   "created_at": "2026-11-16T22:15:52.602033Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/npr.org/post/3n2hkjjmjdo2c",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://n.pr/3XvBehx",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "Jacob Coxon, former researcher at OpenAI and Anthropic who quit and said that AI \"could kill us all by the end of the decade\" defended keeping his OpenAI stock this week by saying \"I like money bro.\"\n\nA clip of the full Stanford HAI talk was shared by Alex Kantrowitz on X.",
   "handle": "404media.co",
   "display_name": "404 Media",
   "likes": 315,
   "reposts": 90,
   "replies": 47,
   "created_at": "2026-11-16T18:36:38.748Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/404media.co/post/3n2h6bj3cv22d",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "This guy got locked out of his Facebook page because he gave his Meta AI agent access. The agent then said to file a federal lawsuit and they did.\n\nPlease enjoy clips of @jasonkoebler.bsky.social speaking to this guy and his AI agent \"Baby Mia\" who kept interrupting: www.404media.co/a-man-and-hi...",
   "handle": "404media.co",
   "display_name": "404 Media",
   "likes": 293,
   "reposts": 83,
   "replies": 19,
   "created_at": "2026-11-17T20:39:56.564Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/404media.co/post/3n2jvmvnjkc27",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "AI agent"
  },
  {
   "text": "Jensen Huang manufactured GPU \"scarcity\" in the early days of the NVIDIA bubble by funding CoreWeave, Lambda, Crusoe, Applied Digital, Nebius, all while shipping nearly $12bn in GPUs to China via megaspeed. NVIDIA's \"massive demand\" was always a mirage.\nwww.wheresyoured.at/the-nvidia-b...",
   "handle": "edzitron.com",
   "display_name": "Ed Zitron",
   "likes": 265,
   "reposts": 56,
   "replies": 5,
   "created_at": "2026-11-17T16:14:31.274Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/edzitron.com/post/3n2jgsc4il52x",
   "image": "img/2026-11-18/1f8e8fef805f5f55.webp",
   "external": "",
   "query": "NVIDIA AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "AI-related construction was a big part of this last year's GDP growth. The midterms + nvidia + unraveling of AI might give the president a lot less to talk about next quarter. (with @svaneksmith.bsky.social) https://newsletter.platypuseconomics.com/p/the-most-expensive-shag-in-history",
   "handle": "justinwolfers.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Justin Wolfers",
   "likes": 276,
   "reposts": 47,
   "replies": 8,
   "created_at": "2026-11-17T03:23:25.458Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/justinwolfers.bsky.social/post/3n2i3phorz72u",
